        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Cowichan Symphony Society presents Child/Student $20 NOTE: Online tickets will be closed on Thursday, January 16 at 5:30pm. Tickets can be purchased at the door before the performance (cash only).  [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
