        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Student $15 Age 14+ only. Content warning: cartoonish sexual content, swear words, puppet suicide, dark lighting, loud music, and surprises. SPICY! A spicy puppet cabaret, hosted by a sassy grandma [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
