        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;19+ audiences only. Show contains mild sexual content and partial nudity. Josephine, a burlesque cabaret dream play is an international award-winning and off-Broadway one-woman biographical musical that combines cabaret, theatre [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
